{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1464810-incarnation-trap-accidental-event-inspiring-facade-tactic","id":1464810,"title":"Incarnation Trap, accidental event inspiring FACADE tactic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-21T17:34:25-07:00","id":1464810,"title":"Incarnation Trap, accidental event inspiring FACADE tactic","content":"I'm pondering how the confluence of two Magickal Effects, namely the Euthanatos' Good Death and Progenitors' Cloning Vats, could produce open ended inter-factional intrigue. <br /> <br /> Situation 1: By accident, a Tradition Mage given the Good Death long ago reincarnates into a perfect adult body with strong brain function, the result of genetic engineering by the Progenitors, and that body was grown in a vat. Before he can begin to recall his past lives, he is taught by staff at the education center. He forms a close connection with Progenitor Mages and ECs who are his default family. He internalizes the Paradigm of the Progenitors whose intervention into biology made his life possible. Then, he begins to recall who he was in his past life; a prophetic figure in the Euthanatos who are eagerly awaiting his return. <br /> <br /> He is sent to Earth by the Technocracy to integrate into the sleeper community in anticipation of operational orders. He considers using the little bit of freedom afforded him to make contact with a Thanatoic Cult. They might regard him as a Prophet worthy of deference or an Abomination requiring elimination.<br /> <br /> Situation 2: From past experience with such accidents, the Progenitors know a little bit about The Good Death and other things causing reincarnation. Working with the Void Engineers, they put some Dimensional Science into an effect intended draw a strong Avatar from the past into an empty husk. It succeeds. They have an important Mage from (pick a Tradition or Craft). The Progenitors consider how to use this situation to their advantage. <br /> <br /> How might each of these stories unfold?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}